{"id":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:hyperplane-nondegenerate","title":"lem:hyperplane-nondegenerate","path":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2.md","line":3250,"body":"","kind":"lemma","status":"not_started","tex":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2.tex#lem:hyperplane-nondegenerate","uses":["[[references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:nondegenerate-subspace]]","[[references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:nondegenerate-line]]","[[references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:orthogonal-complement]]"],"inspired_by":[],"bindings":[],"is_index":false,"body_html":"","formal":[],"tex_content":{"path":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2.tex","label":"lem:hyperplane-nondegenerate","line":5664,"source":"\\begin{lemma}[Nondegeneracy of a Hyperplane]\n\\label{lem:hyperplane-nondegenerate}\n\n\\uses{lem:nondegenerate-subspace, lem:nondegenerate-line, lem:orthogonal-complement}\n\n\n\n\nIf $(V,q)$ is a scalar product space and $\\dim W+1=\\dim V$, then $q|_W$ is nondegenerate if and only if every nonzero $v\\in W^\\perp$ satisfies $\\langle v,v\\rangle\\ne0$.\n\\end{lemma}\n\\begin{proof}\n\n\\uses{lem:nondegenerate-subspace,lem:nondegenerate-line,lem:orthogonal-complement}\n\\sketch Lemma \\ref{lem:nondegenerate-subspace} equates nondegeneracy on $W$ and $W^\\perp$. Lemma \\ref{lem:orthogonal-complement} makes the latter one-dimensional, so Lemma \\ref{lem:nondegenerate-line} applies.\n\\end{proof}","html":" <p></p><section class=\"theorem\"><div class=\"theorem-label\">Lemma</div></section>[Nondegeneracy of a Hyperplane] <span class=\"tex-label\" id=\"tex-label-6c656d3a6879706572706c616e652d6e6f6e646567656e6572617465\"></span> <p></p><a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23lem%3Anondegenerate-subspace\">↗ lem:nondegenerate-subspace</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23lem%3Anondegenerate-line\">↗ lem:nondegenerate-line</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23lem%3Aorthogonal-complement\">↗ lem:orthogonal-complement</a> <p></p>If <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$(V,q)$\">$(V,q)$</span> is a scalar product space and <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$\\dim W+1=\\dim V$\">$\\dim W+1=\\dim V$</span>, then <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$q|_W$\">$q|_W$</span> is nondegenerate if and only if every nonzero <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$v\\in W^\\perp $\">$v\\in W^\\perp $</span> satisfies <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$\\langle v,v\\rangle \\ne 0$\">$\\langle v,v\\rangle \\ne 0$</span>.  <section class=\"theorem proof\"><div class=\"theorem-label\">Proof</div><p><a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23lem%3Anondegenerate-subspace\">↗ lem:nondegenerate-subspace</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23lem%3Anondegenerate-line\">↗ lem:nondegenerate-line</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23lem%3Aorthogonal-complement\">↗ lem:orthogonal-complement</a> \\sketch Lemma <a class=\"reference tex-ref\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23lem%3Anondegenerate-subspace\" data-tex-node=\"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:nondegenerate-subspace\" data-tex-anchor=\"tex-label-6c656d3a6e6f6e646567656e65726174652d7375627370616365\">3</a> equates nondegeneracy on <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$W$\">$W$</span> and <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$W^\\perp $\">$W^\\perp $</span>. Lemma <a class=\"reference tex-ref\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23lem%3Aorthogonal-complement\" data-tex-node=\"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:orthogonal-complement\" data-tex-anchor=\"tex-label-6c656d3a6f7274686f676f6e616c2d636f6d706c656d656e74\">3</a> makes the latter one-dimensional, so Lemma <a class=\"reference tex-ref\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23lem%3Anondegenerate-line\" data-tex-node=\"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:nondegenerate-line\" data-tex-anchor=\"tex-label-6c656d3a6e6f6e646567656e65726174652d6c696e65\">17</a> applies. </p><span class=\"qed\" aria-label=\"证毕\" style=\"display:block;text-align:right\">□</span></section>","warnings":["部分 TeX 排版细节未完整还原（已保留可读内容）: sketch"]},"previous":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:nondegenerate-line","next":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:orthonormal-tail-spans-orthogonal","relations":[{"kind":"uses","id":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:nondegenerate-subspace","title":"lem:nondegenerate-subspace","label":"lem:nondegenerate-subspace"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:nondegenerate-line","title":"lem:nondegenerate-line","label":"lem:nondegenerate-line"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:orthogonal-complement","title":"lem:orthogonal-complement","label":"lem:orthogonal-complement"}],"backlinks":[{"kind":"uses","id":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#prop:pseudo-riemannian-hypersurface-nondegenerate","title":"prop:pseudo-riemannian-hypersurface-nondegenerate","label":"prop:pseudo-riemannian-hypersurface-nondegenerate"}],"copy_context":{"version":1,"level":0,"node":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:hyperplane-nondegenerate","title":"lem:hyperplane-nondegenerate","tex":"\\begin{lemma}[Nondegeneracy of a Hyperplane]\n\\label{lem:hyperplane-nondegenerate}\n\n\\uses{lem:nondegenerate-subspace, lem:nondegenerate-line, lem:orthogonal-complement}\n\n\n\n\nIf $(V,q)$ is a scalar product space and $\\dim W+1=\\dim V$, then $q|_W$ is nondegenerate if and only if every nonzero $v\\in W^\\perp$ satisfies $\\langle v,v\\rangle\\ne0$.\n\\end{lemma}\n\\begin{proof}\n\n\\uses{lem:nondegenerate-subspace,lem:nondegenerate-line,lem:orthogonal-complement}\n\\sketch Lemma \\ref{lem:nondegenerate-subspace} equates nondegeneracy on $W$ and $W^\\perp$. Lemma \\ref{lem:orthogonal-complement} makes the latter one-dimensional, so Lemma \\ref{lem:nondegenerate-line} applies.\n\\end{proof}","source":"tex/references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2.tex","description":"","dependencies":[{"node":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:nondegenerate-subspace","title":"lem:nondegenerate-subspace","description":""},{"node":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:nondegenerate-line","title":"lem:nondegenerate-line","description":""},{"node":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:orthogonal-complement","title":"lem:orthogonal-complement","description":""}],"dependencies_omitted":0,"unresolved_dependencies":[],"unresolved_omitted":0}}